{"title":"The Apex of Dragon Mastery","synopsis":"Combining reality with a gaming world where ferocious beasts roam freely, filled with numerous mysteries and dungeons. In order to defend against the onslaught of these beasts, everyone undergoes class transfers and crazily levels up. On the day of his transfer, Lu Fan becomes a hidden class – Dragon Tamer. However, due to the immense strength of dragons, it is deemed impossible for anyone to tame them, earning Dragon Tamer the reputation of being the most useless class. Fortunately, he awakens the Super Treasure Map System. As Lu Fan, with his mighty dragon, sweeps through everything, the entire world trembles.","alternative_title":"全民转职：驭龙师是最弱职业？, Worthless Profession: Dragon Tamer, Quánmín Zhuǎn Zhí: Yù Lóng Shī Shì Zuì Ruò Zhíyè?","author":"鬼泣双刀坎上天（原著）","artist":"鬼泣双刀坎上天（原著）","genres":["Action"],"chapters":[{"id":"5c3038e3-9786-45d8-b77b-e65e5f8454b4","number":"225","title":"Chapter 225","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"id":"3ae0e204-8cf8-437d-8f1e-0fd238ede597","number":"224","title":"Chapter 224","date":"2026-07-26","images":[]},{"id":"5fb3df95-aae6-41fb-a4e4-ee1bd5429bc4","number":"223","title":"Chapter 223","date":"2026-07-22","images":[]},{"id":"797f903d-14c6-4640-8a5b-29dac9611bfa","number":"222","title":"Chapter 222","date":"2026-07-19","images":[]},{"id":"5cd782f3-5b23-4acb-bd9f-1efc38eedf7e","number":"221","title":"Chapter 221","date":"2026-07-11","images":[]},{"id":"fe853580-c36c-45d9-88a5-cb71e556fdcf","number":"220","title":"Chapter 220","date":"2026-07-02","images":[]},{"id":"965418b1-ecf3-4f08-81d2-4e2d1fc60fda","number":"219","title":"Chapter 219","date":"2026-06-20","images":[]},{"id":"c3fa4219-3fc9-41f9-b559-a54d8eccb715","number":"218","title":"Chapter 218","date":"2026-06-11","images":[]},{"id":"9c39cbd1-fcb9-4071-ad34-4acb838fefb6","number":"217","title":"Chapter 217","date":"2026-06-02","images":[]},{"id":"7b8a5c8d-fe3d-47a8-a34e-cb5bea80c8b2","number":"216","title":"Chapter 216","date":"20